Some few-shot examples after column exploration may be helpful:
Query:
-- 1.  Look at the different genes that are reported as mutated in the
--     BLCA (bladder cancer) cohort – quick sanity-check that CDKN2A exists
SELECT DISTINCT
       "Hugo_Symbol"
FROM   TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED."SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R7"
WHERE  "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'
LIMIT  20;
Answer:
Hugo_Symbol
